{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gkGW5g9qVR1794522145.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。此外，與高空擾動相關的驟雨正逐漸影響廣東西部。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲。日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約26度。下午有幾陣驟雨，晚上驟雨增多及有幾陣狂風雷暴。吹和緩偏東風，離岸風勢清勁，晚上高地間中吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日初時雨勢頗大及有幾陣狂風雷暴，日間驟雨減少，天色好轉。星期日部分時間有陽光。星期一風勢較大及有幾陣雨。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:24:23.058796+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T22:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:37:36.115772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:17:36.875678+00:00","content_hash":"11d25a95f3bb864a6b975510fa0554152aa0cd43db14450a8fbc5f319e681edc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:24:23.058796+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}